.benchmarks/

# Task JSON the jl head-to-head regenerates deterministically from its seeds; the committed artifacts are the summary, results, figures and log.
benchmarks/python/jl_performance/**/tasks/

# Rendered docs site (mdbook build-dir); the source is docs/book/src.
docs/book/site/

